Not vendored (rebuilt as shadcn/ui chart configs, design D3): DonutChart,
SparkChart and every other Recharts-based Tremor component.

Modifications (Ouroboros), all files:
  - React 19: `ref` is an ordinary prop; React.forwardRef removed.
  - `cx`/`focusRing` from Tremor's utils replaced by `cn` and shadcn/ui focus
    ring classes; hard-coded gray/blue/emerald/yellow/red Tailwind classes
    replaced by shadcn theme tokens and the reserved dataviz status tokens
    (`--chart-1..5`, `--status-good/warn/crit`, `--muted-foreground`), so the
    components follow the `.dark` class strategy.
  - `tremor-id` attribute dropped.
Per file:
  - Tracker: Radix `@radix-ui/react-hover-card` replaced by the shadcn/ui
    Tooltip (Base UI); block `color` is a CSS colour value, not a class.
  - CategoryBar: Tremor's `chartColors` class map removed; `colors` are CSS
    colour values applied as inline `background`; Tremor's Tooltip replaced by
    the shadcn/ui Tooltip; optional `labelFormatter` added.
  - ProgressBar / ProgressCircle: `tailwind-variants` removed; the `variant`
    prop maps to a token table (`PROGRESS_COLORS`) and the track is the same
    colour through `color-mix()` at 25 % alpha.
